{"timestamp":1774893259458,"source_app":"agentic-harness","session_id":"7f3bb014-cc8d-4440-8926-e2401cb316dd","hook_event_type":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_use_id":"toolu_01HNboXcnDfSSjvGMXGbYyx1","payload":{"session_id":"7f3bb014-cc8d-4440-8926-e2401cb316dd","transcript_path":"/Users/rivero/.claude/projects/-Users-rivero-ai-agentic-experience-apps-mas-trees-c39aac7b/7f3bb014-cc8d-4440-8926-e2401cb316dd.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/c39aac7b","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/c39aac7b/specs/patch/patch-copyFragment-integration-test.md","content":"# Patch: Commit unstaged copyFragment integration tests\n\n## Metadata\nadw_id: ``\nreview_change_request: `Issue #1: Two copyFragment integration tests (verifying correct argument passing to generateUniqueFragmentTitle) are present in the working tree at studio/test/mas-repository.test.js but are not staged or committed. These tests validate the wiring between copyFragment and the new helper. Resolution: Stage and commit the copyFragment describe block before merging. Severity: tech_debt`\n\n## Issue Summary\n**Original Spec:** n/a\n**Issue:** Two `copyFragment` integration tests exist in the working tree (`studio/test/mas-repository.test.js`, 61 unstaged insertions) but have not been staged or committed. These tests assert that `copyFragment` passes the correct `(requestedTitle, parentPath)` arguments to `generateUniqueFragmentTitle`.\n**Solution:** Stage `studio/test/mas-repository.test.js` and commit the `copyFragment` describe block with the two integration tests.\n\n## Files to Modify\n\n- `studio/test/mas-repository.test.js` \u2014 already modified in working tree; needs to be staged and committed\n\n## Implementation Steps\n\n### Step 1: Verify syntax of the changed file\nRun `node --check` to confirm the working-tree version has no parse errors before staging.\n\n```bash\nnode --check studio/test/mas-repository.test.js\n```\n\n### Step 2: Stage the file\n```bash\ngit add studio/test/mas-repository.test.js\n```\n\n### Step 3: Commit the change\n```bash\ngit commit -m \"test(studio): add copyFragment \u2192 generateUniqueFragmentTitle integration tests\"\n```\n\n## Validation\n\n```bash\nnode --check studio/test/mas-repository.test.js\n```\n\n```bash\ncd studio && npx web-test-runner test/mas-repository.test.js --node-resolve 2>&1 | grep -E \"copyFragment|passed|failed|error\"\n```\n\n```bash\ngit show --stat HEAD\n```\nConfirm the commit contains only `studio/test/mas-repository.test.js` with ~61 insertions.\n\n## Patch Scope\n**Lines of code to change:** 0 (tests already written; only staging + committing required)\n**Risk level:** low\n**Testing required:** `node --check` passes; `copyFragment` describe block's two tests pass in `web-test-runner`\n"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HNboXcnDfSSjvGMXGbYyx1"}}
